# Deprecation: `patterns/` and `styles/` (`packages/ui/src`)

**These trees are legacy and being phased out.** Do not extend them or add new dependencies on them.

## Do not (for any **new** work)

- Add or edit **product** code under **`packages/ui/src/patterns/`** or **`packages/ui/src/styles/`** except when doing an explicit **migration, removal, or mechanical fix** requested by the owner.
- Add **`@use` / `@forward` / `@import`** from `patterns/**` or `styles/**` into **`tokens/`**, **`framework/`**, **`components/`**, or apps.
- Add **new** deep/relative imports from `patterns/` or `styles/` in TS, SCSS, or Storybook (including from other packages in this monorepo).
- Introduce **new** `@repo/ui/styles/*` usage; prefer **`@repo/ui/framework`** (or the documented framework entry) per **`linking-standards.mdc`**.

## Do instead

- **New** tokens → **`packages/ui/src/tokens/`**
- **New** global / site CSS → **`packages/ui/src/framework/`**
- **New** reusable UI (React + modules + stories) → **`packages/ui/src/components/`** (functional groupings)

See **`readboot-scss-architecture.mdc`** for the folder map and authoring rules.

## Note on public exports

`@repo/ui/atoms`, `molecules`, `organisms`, `templates` may still resolve into `patterns/` **until those exports are repointed**. **Do not** add *additional* internal coupling to `patterns/**` or `styles/**` from greenfield code; prefer **`components/`** and **`tokens/`** / **`framework/`** for anything newly authored.
